{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51128","headline":"逢汉使入蕃略题四韵 · 慧超","name":"逢汉使入蕃略题四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君恨西蕃远，余嗟东路长。\n道荒宏雪岭，险涧贼途倡。\n鸟飞惊峭嶷，人去□偏梁。\n平生不扪泪，今日洒千行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧超","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}